# API modules (`src/api/`)

```js
import axiosClient from "./axiosClient";
import { getApiData } from "../utils/apiError";
import { parsePagedResponse } from "../utils/pagination";

const unwrap = (p) => p.then((res) => getApiData(res));
const unwrapPaged = (p, fallbackSize) =>
  p.then((res) => parsePagedResponse(getApiData(res), fallbackSize));
```

- **List**: `unwrapPaged(axiosClient.get(path, { params }))` — query `page` (0-based), `size`.
- **Single / mutation**: `unwrap(axiosClient.get|post|put|patch|delete(...))`.
- Không parse `items`/`total`. Chuẩn: `content`, `totalElements`, `totalPages`.
- Tên file: `admin<Domain>Api.js`, export named functions.
